<div class="component container col-12">
    <div class="component-content" >

    <div class="component footnotes col-12">
        <div class="component-content">
<div class="cf-footnotes">
    <h5>Footnotes</h5>
        <ol>
                    <li id="cf-fn-1">See, e.g., Ben S. Bernanke, <a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="http://www.federalreserve.gov/newsevents/speech/bernanke20060224a.htm">&ldquo;The Benefits of Price Stability,&rdquo;</a> Center for Economic Policy Studies, Princeton University, Princeton, New Jersey, February 24, 2006, and Charles I. Plosser, <a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="https://www.philadelphiafed.org/publications/speeches/plosser/2011/04-14-11_20th-annual-minsky-conference">&ldquo;Strengthening Our Monetary Policy Framework,&rdquo;</a> 20th Annual Hyman P. Minsky Conference, New York, NY, April 14, 2011.
                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-1" aria-label="Return from footnote 1.">Return to 1</a>
                    </li>
