                        <a href="#cf-fn-ret-4" aria-label="Return from footnote 4.">Return to 4</a>
                    </li>
                    <li id="cf-fn-5">See Dean Croushore, <a rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="offsite" href="http://www.philadelphiafed.org/research-and-data/publications/working-papers/2008/wp08-8.pdf">&ldquo;Revisions to PCE Inflation Measures: Implications for Monetary Policy,&rdquo;</a> Federal Reserve Bank of Philadelphia Working Paper No. 08-8, May 2008.
